    "10": {
      "text": "<C:0001,0004,><C:0000,0003,2C65FFFF>Şu büyük \"S\" simgesini,<U:000A>yani Kaydet simgesini görüyor musun?<C:0000,0003,000000FF><C:0003,0001,>",
